                {
                    "q": "How do I receive my payments?",
                    "a": "Sety does not act as an intermediary in the payment process. You connect your own Iyzico, Stripe or other payment infrastructure to the system. When your customer buys a product, the payment is deposited directly into your own account at your payment provider."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Does Sety take commission from my sales?",
                    "a": "No, Sety does not take commission from any sales. You only pay a fixed monthly subscription fee. No matter how much your sales volume increases, 100% of your earnings remain yours."
                },
                {
                    "q": "Is it difficult to connect my own payment infrastructure?",
                    "a": "Not at all! You can connect popular payment methods like Iyzico or Stripe in seconds by entering your API keys with just a few clicks through our panel."
                },
                {
                    "q": "How do refund and cancellation processes work?",
                    "a": "Since the money flow takes place directly between you and your customer (via your own payment infrastructure), refund and cancellation processes are also entirely under your control. Sety does not interfere in this process."
                },
                {
                    "q": "How are tax processes managed?",
                    "a": "Since sales take place over your own payment infrastructure, billing and tax processes are managed by you according to your existing business model. As a professional store owner, you are in control of all processes."
                },
